  "scope": [
    "Four serial ABBA fresh full source-to-Object observations; no builds, tests, fixtures or CPU sampling overlap primary timing.",
    "The updated control includes PR 973 commit 79e0649f; both subjects enable the same 53 flags including MECH_CARRY_REDUCTION_BOUND. Its preexisting runtime optimization is independent of this index.",
    "A separate updated-control compile with the prior 52 flags reproduces all previous output bytes. The first wrapper attempt could not access macOS clockrate statistics; all four outputs were written and match, but that failed process is excluded. The identical integration retry uses host process statistics and succeeds.",
    "The reduction-bound option changes helper code versus the earlier 52-flag profile. Only matched 53-flag control/candidate results qualify this index.",
    "Every source, bytecode, native Object and complete metadata byte matches between control and candidate in all primary observations and six complete fixtures.",
    "Only descriptive operation references, contracts, operand identities and schema IDs are indexed per immutable artifact owner. No selected factory, semantic witness, proof, current visit, or runtime admission is cached.",
    "Factory selection, type/contract checks, ownership, current-visit validation and finite admission retain their original boundaries.",
    "Index collection preserves original traversal order, first duplicate identity and first metadata failure. Earlier queried sites retain their original result before a later malformed declaration; current comprehension sites precede duplicate-local rejection.",
    "Immutable clones share descriptive cache data; separately finalized/decoded artifacts start fresh. Cache state changes neither revision nor bytecode encoding. No unsafe pointers or global/revision-keyed cache is introduced.",
    "All 30 focused tests pass, including 114688 differential descriptor queries against the original ordered walker, template and image checks, current-visit validation and bytecode.",
    "The first test compile has an ambiguous integer loop type. The corrected cfg(test) annotation leaves every production patch chunk and the frozen release executable hash unchanged; both build records and failed test evidence remain.",
    "Native intervals are nested within the native total. Numeric helper generation includes lowering, optimization and emission. Unchanged-stage variation is not attributed to indexing.",
    "All adverse elapsed, instruction and resident-memory observations are retained; four observations do not establish a statistical population or causal whole-compiler memory saving.",
    "The enum-state helper uses the maintained complete fixture assembly; copied historical fragment-only failure provenance is not a launch in this cohort.",
    "Grammar, language semantics and emitted runtime program bytes are unchanged by indexing. No new runtime-speed campaign is claimed.",
    "Compiler bootstrap is excluded from program compilation. Executables remain local, represented by exact commands, source patch and hashes. The full-compilation sub-ten-second goal remains open."
